- Try to create working dir if it does not exist;
- Replaced System.out.println statements with logging messages;
- Added sample script entry to default config.xml in web app;
- Added some Javadoc comments.

git-svn-id: https://svn.code.sf.net/p/teamengine/code/branches/ows9@716 24c30046-25e5-4eec-8353-25991c8b1332

- Updated development version (4.0-beta2-SNAPSHOT);
- [TE-10]: Added Status field to table on welcome page (default value is 'Final');
- [TE-10]: Sort suites in table by name and version (both in ascending order);
- [TE-10]: Added logo to welcome header;
- [TE-10]: Revised welcome text.

