[CITE #663] Cast first argument to substring() function (in generate_xsl.xsl) as xs:string to fix stylesheet compilation errors; 
Added root directory for ETS documentation (TE_BASE/resources/docs).

git-svn-id: https://svn.code.sf.net/p/teamengine/code/branches/ows9@756 24c30046-25e5-4eec-8353-25991c8b1332

- [core] Warning verdict no longer taints ancestor tests with inherited failure;
- [web] GetStatus polling interval increased to 4s (from 1s).

